[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1310","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1310.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1056","title":"HP OpenVMS Monitor 实用程序本地权限提升漏洞","description":"VMS 操作系统 Monitor 工具（SYS$SHARE:SPISHR.EXE）存在本地权限提升漏洞，影响 VMS 5.0 至 5.4-2 版本。本地用户可利用该工具在处理权限控制时的缺陷，通过执行特制操作获得系统级特权，从而完全控制目标主机。该漏洞 CVSS v2 评分 7.2，危害等级高，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，无需用户交互即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1056"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1992-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:55:06Z","remediation":"此 CVE 编号已被标记为 REJECT（与 CVE-1999-1395 重复），不存在实际安全漏洞，无需进行任何修复操作。请直接参考 CVE-1999-1395 对应的真实漏洞信息进行修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/638563f1ec085a412c2e42f3935801ae34f0dfd9/1999/CVE-1999-1056.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/42b5b7a8a9b34b1b292b9bfd27242e499ccb6cb9/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1056.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1056","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/21d84550d4f5d6b78cac9f7c41b1b20a874c9f15/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1056.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1056.md","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1056.json","https://github.com/Christopher0129/security-knowledge-base/blob/ecec748afe5bbe2fcd2fd04b00fb46bc827b2c5d/network-security/index.md","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/61bcf264a889b94a48e2596863419b7c30791e0f/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-10xx/CVE-1999-1056.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1310.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1282","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1282.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1021","title":"SunOS NFS 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SunOS 4.1 至 4.1.2 版本的 NFS 服务在处理 32 位 UID 时仅检查低 16 位而忽略高 16 位，导致本地用户可将自身 UID 的低 16 位设置为 0 来冒充 root 用户（UID 0），从而获取超级用户权限。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，通过构造特定 UID 值的进程即可绕过 NFS 的权限检查机制，实现对文件系统的越权访问。Sun 官方已发布 NFS jumbo patch 补丁修复该问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1021"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1992-12-30T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装 Sun 官方发布的 NFS jumbo patch 补丁，该补丁修复了 NFS 对 32 位 UID 高 16 位处理不当的问题；在无法立即打补丁的情况下，应在 /etc/exports 中限制 NFS 导出目录仅对可信主机开放，并通过防火墙限制对 2049 端口的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/117&type=0&nav=sec.sba","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1992-15.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/47","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/82"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1282.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1533","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1533.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1466","title":"Cisco IOS 访问控制列表安全绕过漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 系统 8.2 至 9.1 版本存在访问控制列表绕过漏洞。当特定接口配置了扩展 IP 访问列表、启用 IP 路由缓存且访问列表使用了 \"established\" 关键字时，远程攻击者可利用 TCP 会话欺骗技术绕过 ACL 过滤规则，实现未授权网络访问。该漏洞影响大量 Cisco 路由器设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1466"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1992-12-10T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:30Z","remediation":"立即升级 Cisco IOS 至 9.1.1 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 9.1.1 中修复。如无法升级，可在受影响接口下执行 `no ip route-cache` 禁用 IP 路由缓存（快速转发），强制每个数据包通过 CPU 重新评估 ACL；或将扩展 ACL 中的 `established` 关键词替换为具体的单向规则（如明确允许/拒绝返回流量的源端口范围），避免依赖状态匹配逻辑。同时建议迁移至 Cisco IOS 12.0 及以上版本以获得持续安全支持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1992-20.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5102a7cca13b4c0a0e55e628783c406707da47e/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1466.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1466","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1466.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e55eacb4f05da66af6c788dc1e36dafe4a12a8f8/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1466.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/78550cb05ca9623089e78169330acf979f4b64ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f5hf-wrxf-wr76/GHSA-f5hf-wrxf-wr76.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/53/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154600_154700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d89c8171-c445-4de1-aa69-c34360cbe39e.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1466.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/5721d007794215ff21176b4cb4c7f370781f5dd1/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1533.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1469","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1469.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1306","title":"Cisco IOS 访问控制列表绕过漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 9.1 及更早版本中存在访问控制列表绕过漏洞。当启用 IP 路由缓存且设置了 \"established\" 关键字时，系统无法正确处理扩展 IP 访问列表规则，导致攻击者可以绕过 ACL 过滤策略，发送非授权网络流量。远程攻击者无需认证即可利用此漏洞，影响运行受影响版本 Cisco IOS 的网络设备，可能导致未授权访问或信息泄露。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1306"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1992-12-10T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:09Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至 9.1.2 或更高版本。临时缓解措施：(1) 在应用扩展 ACL 的接口上执行 `no ip route-cache` 关闭快速交换模式，强制使用进程交换以正确评估 ACL；(2) 如无法升级，避免在扩展 ACL 中使用 `established` 关键字，改用具体源目端口的精确匹配规则。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1992-20.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/851a313c6bc1948d5487aca773aa21ade52b7c28/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1306.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1306","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1306.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/929f101fd7b4d4314a4b92f62a8cc2523c6d76f0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1306.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-363m-9h8j-6gw4/GHSA-363m-9h8j-6gw4.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1306.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154600_154700.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000028.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/0a362f4f57e067cbdfd1de47d6fffa5dd1479d2e/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1469.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1493","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1493.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1395","title":"DEC OpenVMS Monitor 工具本地权限提升漏洞","description":"DEC OpenVMS 操作系统的 Monitor 实用程序（SYS$SHARE:SPISHR.EXE）存在权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可利用该程序的安全缺陷，通过执行精心构造的操作获得超越自身权限的系统级访问能力，进而完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响 VMS 5.0 至 5.4-2 版本，需要攻击者具有本地系统访问权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1395"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1992-11-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:20Z","remediation":"升级 OpenVMS 至 5.4-3 或更高版本以修复 Monitor 工具（SYS$SHARE:SPISHR.EXE）的权限提升漏洞。如无法立即升级，应移除该文件的 SUID 权限，并限制其仅允许系统管理员组执行，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/59332","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1992-18.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-92.16.VMS.Monitor.vulnerability","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7136.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/51","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/1999/CVE-1999-1056.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/36911ad057245f7d02822794db0f459d9b4c9b8f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1395.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1395","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1395.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3012e5f1cf9bcfe839897275a956236aed334269/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1395.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f6fq-4j2q-5883/GHSA-f6fq-4j2q-5883.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1056.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/51/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154600_154700.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1493.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1494","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1494.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1396","title":"Sun SunOS SPARC 整数乘法模拟代码本地权限提升与拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SunOS 4.1 至 4.1.2 版本中 SPARC 架构的整数乘法模拟代码存在漏洞，本地攻击者可通过执行特制程序触发整数溢出，导致系统崩溃或获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SunOS 4.1/4.1.1/4.1.2 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地账户访问权限方可利用，无法远程触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1396"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1992-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:21Z","remediation":"立即升级 SunOS 至 4.1.3 或更新版本，该版本已修复整数乘法模拟代码中的漏洞。对于无法升级的 4.1/4.1.1/4.1.2 系统，请联系 Sun 支持获取对应版本的独立补丁。临时缓解措施包括限制本地用户登录权限并审计可疑的特权提升行为。长期建议迁移至 Solaris 2.x 系列以获取持续安全支持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1992-15.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7150.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/49","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/63f7cdb3d3ebf7bfe8ef6a2325af30a024b23325/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1396.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1396","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1396.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/175fba1f481a7f7cf5bdb5344d3c0e47af1884ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1396.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa37ed0317ce1265b487f92916077b9ccbfe3349/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x46p-x83j-9q7p/GHSA-x46p-x83j-9q7p.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/49/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154600_154700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1396.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c67d0d59-75ce-4c09-ad76-bac410776f76.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8eedf1cb11548f43d573399be49eeffcf4f32e25/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1494.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0401","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0401.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0214","title":"Sun SunOS 4.1 ICMP Unreachable 报文拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Sun Microsystems SunOS 4.1/4.1.1/4.1.2 操作系统存在 ICMP 不可达数据包处理缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标主机发送伪造的 ICMP Unreachable 数据包，导致目标系统内核错误地关闭受影响 TCP 连接，造成合法服务中断。该漏洞影响所有运行上述版本 SunOS 的系统，攻击门槛低、危害较大。厂商已发布相应补丁修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0214"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1992-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:55Z","remediation":"升级 SunOS 至 4.1.3 或更高版本，该版本修复了 ICMP Unreachable 报文处理逻辑。在网络边界防火墙配置规则，过滤外部传入的伪造 ICMP 不可达数据包。如系统仍在使用且无法升级，可考虑迁移至受支持的 Solaris 版本。禁用不必要的 ICMP 响应功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0214"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0401.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0339","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0339.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0168","title":"Sun SunOS RPC Portmapper 代理重定向认证绕过漏洞","description":"Solaris 等 UNIX 系统中运行的 portmapper（端口映射服务）存在访问控制绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统的 portmapper 发送特制的服务请求，使其充当代理将请求重定向至本地主机，从而绕过源 IP 认证机制。攻击者利用此漏洞可绕过 NFS 导出限制远程挂载文件系统，获取敏感文件访问权限。该漏洞无需认证即可远程利用，影响面广泛，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0168"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1992-06-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:44Z","remediation":"在防火墙上限制对 TCP/UDP 111 端口的访问，仅允许受信任主机连接 rpcbind 服务。对于 NFS 导出，添加 `-secure` 选项并要求仅从保留端口连接。升级使用支持 RPCSEC_GSS 认证的现代操作系统版本（如 Solaris 10+ 或 Linux 发行版），并启用 iptables/nftables 规则过滤对 rpcbind 的访问。如 NFS 非必要，可通过 `/etc/init.d/nfs` stop 禁用相关服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0168"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0339.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1356","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1356.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1142","title":"Sun SunOS 动态链接程序环境变量注入权限提升漏洞","description":"SunOS 4.1.2 及更早版本中存在权限提升漏洞，本地用户可通过向动态链接的 setuid/setgid 程序（如 login、su、sendmail）设置 LD_* 环境变量（如 LD_PRELOAD）来劫持动态链接库，从而以提升后的权限执行任意代码。该漏洞利用条件为拥有本地系统访问权限，攻击者可通过加载恶意共享库绕过权限检查，获取 root 权限。此漏洞影响范围广泛，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1142"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1992-05-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:48Z","remediation":"升级 SunOS 至 4.1.3 或更高版本，该版本修复了动态链接 setuid/setgid 程序对 LD_* 环境变量的处理。如无法升级，可移除受影响程序的 setuid/setgid 权限位（如 chmod u-s /usr/bin/login），或通过系统安全补丁集禁用 LD_PRELOAD/LD_LIBRARY_PATH 在 setuid 程序中的传递。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/116","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1992-11.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3152","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aa3114da1227373bef7855dba21bcaa5f0e0ad76/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1142.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1142","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1142.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4d2ed764072119c12b6f84e6ee4e0df62586a8c4/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1142.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/95e6ff620d5494b93ba2234edfcf6a45187dc0a8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wx92-67c9-p24w/GHSA-wx92-67c9-p24w.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154600_154700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1142.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5f9a0185-9734-441d-abe3-7193c1e258fc.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/Christopher0129/security-knowledge-base/blob/ecec748afe5bbe2fcd2fd04b00fb46bc827b2c5d/network-security/index.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1356.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1340","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1340.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1119","title":"IBM AIX 匿名FTP配置远程代码执行漏洞","description":"AIX 系统中 FTP 安装脚本 anon.ftp 默认配置不当，将匿名 FTP 服务设置为不安全状态，允许远程攻击者无需认证即可连接目标系统。攻击者可利用该配置缺陷上传恶意文件或执行任意系统命令，导致服务器被完全控制。此漏洞影响 IBM AIX 操作系统，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议立即修复 FTP 服务配置或禁用匿名访问。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1119"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1992-04-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:45Z","remediation":"立即检查 AIX 系统中 /etc/ftpusers 和 anon.ftp 脚本权限，确保匿名 FTP 脚本不可被非授权用户修改。升级 AIX 至已修复此问题的最新维护级别（如 AIX 4.3 及以上版本）。如无需匿名 FTP 服务，建议在 /etc/inetd.conf 中注释 ftp 行并重启 inetd 以禁用该服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1992-09.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/41","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3154","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/712a40967986b700313860b08048435be4fa9839/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1119.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1119","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1119.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/248c2167e720df96125f6ac9925793063a207510/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1119.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xmf4-5rj8-j896/GHSA-xmf4-5rj8-j896.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1119.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154600_154700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--dc5d0eb4-48b6-40f5-97db-caa33f1b462f.json","https://github.com/augustozarate/integrated-security-scanner/blob/f1af60b35a67d2c1e8d6e4e4cf7bc7b74c32edf0/README.es.md","https://github.com/Christopher0129/security-knowledge-base/blob/ecec748afe5bbe2fcd2fd04b00fb46bc827b2c5d/network-security/index.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1340.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0260","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0260.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0117","title":"IBM AIX passwd 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"AIX 操作系统中的 passwd 命令存在本地权限提升漏洞。由于 passwd 程序在处理用户密码更改操作时未充分检查权限，本地普通用户可通过执行特制的 passwd 命令利用该漏洞获取 root 权限。攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可提权至 root，从而完全控制系统。该漏洞影响早期版本的 AIX 操作系统，CVSS v2 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0117"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1992-03-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:37Z","remediation":"立即安装 IBM AIX 对应版本的 APAR 安全补丁（如 APAR IX47474 或更新版本），或升级至 AIX 4.1 及以上已修复版本。临时缓解措施可移除 passwd 命令的 SUID 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/passwd），但可能导致普通用户无法自行修改密码，需通过 root 管理员代为操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0117"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0260.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1341","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1341.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1121","title":"IBM AIX UUCP 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"UUCP（Unix-to-Unix Copy Protocol）在 AIX 3.2 之前版本的默认配置存在权限控制缺陷，本地攻击者可利用该配置漏洞直接获取 root 用户权限。该漏洞源于 UUCP 服务的文件权限和默认设置不当，攻击者仅需拥有系统本地访问权限即可实施提权攻击，无需其他认证条件。影响范围包括 AIX 3.2 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1121"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1992-03-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:45Z","remediation":"升级 AIX 系统至 3.2 及以上版本，或修改 UUCP 配置文件（/etc/uucp/*）权限，限制非授权用户对 UUCP 程序的访问，移除 uucp 用户组中不必要的本地用户，并确保 uucp 相关 SUID 程序仅对 root 可执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1992-06.html","http://www.osvdb.org/891","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/38","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/554","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/712a40967986b700313860b08048435be4fa9839/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1121.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1121","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1121.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/248c2167e720df96125f6ac9925793063a207510/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1121.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hpvq-q2w4-5255/GHSA-hpvq-q2w4-5255.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154600_154700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1121.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--82250b08-0a3b-45ce-88b9-a5c4e2c6cf17.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/Christopher0129/security-knowledge-base/blob/ecec748afe5bbe2fcd2fd04b00fb46bc827b2c5d/network-security/index.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1341.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0927","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0927.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0627","title":"AIX rexd 服务认证弱漏洞","description":"AIX 系统上的 rexd（远程执行守护进程）服务默认启用，该服务使用基于主机名/IP 地址的弱认证机制，未对用户身份进行加密验证。远程攻击者可通过伪造源地址或利用信任关系绕过认证，直接向目标系统发送执行命令请求，导致任意命令执行。该漏洞影响多个 AIX 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害严重。建议禁用 rexd 服务或配置严格访问控制列表。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0627"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1992-03-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:45Z","remediation":"关闭并禁用 AIX 系统的 rexd 服务（执行 `stopsrc -s rexd` 并将 `/etc/inetd.conf` 中 rexd 行注释掉后重启 inetd），或在防火墙/TCP Wrapper 的 `/etc/hosts.allow`、`/etc/hosts.deny` 中限制仅可信主机可访问 512 端口，禁止将 rexd 暴露于不可信网络。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0627","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d7236390d3d65194e590e3c8620543620af3984/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0627.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0627","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0627.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6d3a932c05085f06507d23e5a0893fa8fe64ce42/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0627.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1ef90eac7bb1a353721fe038daf41872bdff01c4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3jw7-6432-3rpc/GHSA-3jw7-6432-3rpc.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/c422e48dc56726d2d6118a1549ab8a7864e96b47/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/rpc_rexd.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/berez23/canvas/blob/cb306a9d8b1d8a743049a29164e6d324f8dabbfa/exploits/remote/unix/rexd/rexd.py","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c23ad3c1-73a9-4c28-89b9-830a2ebc7be7.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0927.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1312","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1312.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1059","title":"AT&T TCP/IP 4.0 (SVR4) rexecd 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"AT&T TCP/IP 4.0 远程执行守护进程（rexecd）在多种 SVR4 系统上存在命令注入漏洞。该守护进程在处理远程执行请求时，未对传入的命令参数进行充分校验与过滤，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造恶意请求，使 rexecd 以目标服务权限执行任意系统命令。影响范围涵盖运行 AT&T TCP/IP 4.0 的各 SVR4 类操作系统。攻击者只需能够与目标主机的 rexec 服务（TCP 512 端口）建立网络连接，并发送特制的执行请求即可完成利用，无需本地账户，CVSS 评分高达 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1059"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1992-02-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:37Z","remediation":"升级到 AT&T TCP/IP 4.0 的官方修复补丁版本，或停用 rexecd 服务（执行 `chkconfig rexec off` 并 kill 进程）。在防火墙/边界路由器上阻断 TCP 512 端口的入站连接，禁止来自不可信网络的 rexec 访问，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1992-04.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/3159.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/36","https://g